Package: k230-kernel-abi
Architecture: riscv64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: K230 kernel ABI marker
 Records the exact configured K230 kernel release used by out-of-tree module
 packages. It does not provide a kernel image.

Package: k230-sharp-drm
Architecture: riscv64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, kmod, k230-kernel-abi (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Sharp memory-display DRM module for K230
 K230 ABI-specific Sharp memory-display DRM kernel module, compiled from the
 repository's canonical source against the selected prepared kernel tree.
